{
  "id": "avengers-2018-2",
  "name": "Still Avenging After All These Years",
  "synopsis": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Black Panther and Dr. Strange battle for their lives deep within the earth..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Captain Marvel battles death and destruction raining down from the skies..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "...while Thor, Iron Man and Captain America lead the valiant (yet hopeless) fight against the Final Host of Dark Celestials."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "And Ghost Rider and the Savage Hulk make brutal war against...each other?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Plus, you can't have a gathering of Avengers without a certain Prince of Lies, now can you?"
    }
